{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27300","headline":"前相国赞皇公早葺平泉山居蹔还憩旋起赴诏命作镇浙右輙抒怀赋四言诗十四首奉寄 二 · 裴潾","name":"前相国赞皇公早葺平泉山居蹔还憩旋起赴诏命作镇浙右輙抒怀赋四言诗十四首奉寄 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"植爱在根，锺福有兆。\n珠潜巨海，玉蕴崑峤。\n披室生白，照夜成昼。\n挥翰飞文，入侍左右。\n出纳帝命，弘兹在宥。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"裴潾","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27300.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27300","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}